# ColdStore data artifacts: containers, indexes and the user-data
# quarantine/journal directories must never be committed (large and/or
# user-private) — ADV-N8 lists the quarantine/journal locations
# explicitly so even a misplaced copy is never committed.
# NOTE (P2 review B1): rules must stay anchored/root-scoped — bare
# "quarantine/" matches at EVERY tree level and silently ignored
# crates/coldstore-core/src/quarantine/{mod,journal}.rs, so the P2 core
# sources never entered the commit (clean checkout failed E0583).
# User-data quarantine lives under %USERPROFILE%\.coldstore\ (covered
# by .coldstore/); the two lines below are the historical user-data
# locations, kept root-anchored for misplaced-copy protection only.
*.coldstore
*.idx
.coldstore/
/.coldstore-quarantine/
/.coldstore-journal/

# OS noise
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
